{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"The Mark On the Sword: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja126'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 126 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Kusanāḷivagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Reed-stalk Chapter </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>6. Asilakkhaṇajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Mark On the Sword: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Tadevekassa kalyāṇaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>That is good for some, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>tadevekassa pāpakaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>ill for others. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Tasmā sabbaṁ na kalyāṇaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Therefore not all is good, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>sabbaṁ vāpi na pāpakan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>nor is all ill. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Asilakkhaṇajātakaṁ chaṭṭhaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
